Package: cellprograms
Type: Package
Title: Cell-Type-Specific Transcriptional Programs from Pseudobulk Single-Cell RNA-seq
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mikhael", "Manurung", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mikhael@example.org")
Description: Discovers cell-type-specific transcriptional programs from
    pseudobulk single-cell RNA-seq data using empirical-Bayes matrix
    factorization (flashier). Programs are discovered locally within each
    cell type; coordination across cell types is investigated subsequently
    through a principled borrowing ladder: shared EBNM priors (L1),
    initialization borrowing (L2), structured joint decomposition via
    block EBMF or EV-BIDIFAC (L3), and principal-angle program alignment
    (L4). Sharing is an output, not an assumption.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    flashier (>= 1.0.0),
    ebnm (>= 1.0.0),
    ashr
Suggests:
    fastICA,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
